    <data key="d0">Extreme Reach - Adbridge Media Distribution Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1" />
    <data key="d2">Extreme Reach Adbridge platform uses S3, CloudFront, SQS, and EC2 fleets for video transcode, QC, and global ad delivery.</data>
